msgstr "Refined Admin Dashboard"

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:37
msgid ""
"A full rethink of the WordPress admin: smart dashboard, reworked navigation, "
"redesigned content tables, dark mode, and your branding."
msgstr ""
"Eine komplette Neugestaltung des WordPress-Backends: intelligentes "
"Dashboard, überarbeitete Navigation, neu gestaltete Inhaltstabellen, Dark "
"Mode und dein Branding."

