#: src/Modules/MediaLibrary/MediaLibrary.php:97
msgid "Refined Media Library"
msgstr "Refined Media Library"

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:48
msgid ""
"Folders and collections, drag & drop, quick preview, duplicate & orphan "
"cleanup, plus WebP/AVIF conversion on upload."
msgstr ""
"Ordner und Sammlungen, Drag & Drop, Schnellvorschau, Bereinigung von "
"Duplikaten und verwaisten Dateien, plus WebP/AVIF-Konvertierung beim Upload."

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:55
msgid "Simple Performance"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:56
msgid ""
"Caching, CSS/JS, lazy-load, responsive WebP/AVIF delivery, self-hosted "
"fonts, and a native Cloudflare CDN."
msgstr ""
"Caching, CSS/JS, Lazy-Loading, responsive WebP/AVIF-Auslieferung, selbst "
"gehostete Schriften und ein nativer Cloudflare-CDN."

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:65
msgid "Simple Static"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:66
msgid ""
"Static HTML export to shrink your attack surface and host free on Cloudflare "
"Pages, Netlify or GitHub Pages."
msgstr ""
"Statischer HTML-Export, um deine Angriffsfläche zu verkleinern und kostenlos "
"auf Cloudflare Pages, Netlify oder GitHub Pages zu hosten."

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:76
msgid "Simple SEO & Accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:77
msgid ""
"Completes Rank Math on accessibility: auto aria-labels, AI alt-text, and a "
"WCAG audit."
msgstr ""
"Ergänzt Rank Math bei der Barrierefreiheit: automatische Aria-Labels, KI-"
"Alternativtext und WCAG-Audit."

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:84
msgid "Simple Metrics"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:85
msgid ""
"PageSpeed Insights tracking in the admin: per-page history over time, on "
"mobile and desktop."
msgstr ""
"PageSpeed-Insights-Tracking im Backend: Verlauf pro Seite über die Zeit, auf "
"Mobil und Desktop."

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:92
msgid "Simple Backups"
msgstr ""

#: src/Core/ModuleCatalog.php:93
msgid ""
"Scheduled full or DB-only backups, with rotation and one-click restore (auto-"
"snapshot first)."
msgstr ""
"Geplante Voll- oder Nur-DB-Backups, mit Rotation und Wiederherstellung per "
"Klick (zuerst automatischer Snapshot)."

